cost: what drives the number","slug":"erp-implementation-cost","category":"Guide","excerpt":"ERP implementation cost isn't one number — it's licenses plus services plus your own team's time. Here's what actually drives the price, a realistic cost breakdown, and how to keep the total from running away.","readMin":6,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/erp-cost-smartfactory-office.webp","imageAlt":"Executives reviewing ERP implementation cost in a glass office overlooking an automated production line"},{"title":"ERP implementation phases: the step-by-step guide","slug":"erp-implementation-phases","category":"Guide","excerpt":"The ERP implementation phases are discovery, design, build, data migration, testing, training, go-live, and support. Here's the step-by-step guide to each phase, what it delivers, and where projects go wrong.","readMin":7,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/erp-phases-tech.webp","imageAlt":"An ERP implementation team reviewing a project dashboard, illustrating the phases of an ERP implementation"},{"title":"How to choose the right ERP (not the most expensive)","slug":"how-to-choose-an-erp","category":"Guide","excerpt":"How to choose an ERP without overpaying: a vendor-neutral, step-by-step way to score NetSuite, SAP, Odoo, Dynamics, and Acumatica against what your business actually needs — not the longest feature list.","readMin":6,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/erp-choose-logos.webp","imageAlt":"ERP platform logos including SAP, Odoo, NetSuite, Dynamics and Sage, illustrating how to choose the right ERP"},{"title":"NetSuite vs Odoo vs Dynamics: which ERP fits?","slug":"netsuite-vs-odoo-vs-dynamics","category":"Guide","excerpt":"A vendor-neutral NetSuite vs Odoo ERP comparison — plus Microsoft Dynamics. We map fit, cost, and complexity so US companies pick the ERP the business actually needs, not the most expensive one.","readMin":6,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/erp-netsuite-vs-logos.webp","imageAlt":"NetSuite vs Odoo vs Dynamics logos, comparing the leading ERP platforms"}],"className":"mt-8"}]]}]
